>> Animal := Wanta haaraa.
>> Factory := Wanta haaraa.

Animal irratti: ['haaraa'] godhi: {
	>> animal := ofii haaraa.
	animal sound: ['?']. <- animal.
}.

Animal irratti: ['sound:'] godhi: { :s
	koo sound := s.
}.

Animal irratti: ['sound'] godhi: { <- koo sound.
}.

>> Dog := Wanta haaraa.
>> Cat := Wanta haaraa.

Dog irratti: ['haaraa'] godhi: { <- Animal haaraa sound: ['woof!'].
}.

Cat irratti: ['haaraa'] godhi: { <- Animal haaraa sound: ['meow!'].
}.

Baʼii barreessi: Dog haaraa sound, dhaabi.
Baʼii barreessi: Cat haaraa sound, dhaabi.

Factory irratti: ['mix:and:'] godhi: { :beast1 :beast2 <- Animal haaraa sound: (
		( beast1 sound irraa: 0 dheerina: 2 ) +
		( beast2 sound irraa: 2 dheerina: 5 )
	).
}.

Baʼii barreessi: (Factory mix: Dog haaraa and: Cat haaraa) sound, dhaabi.
